s=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f4c10983-d44b-4202-9b84-52edc8394df7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f4c10983-d44b-4202-9b84-52edc8394df7\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Barren%27s_Coop\" title=\"Barren's Coop\">Barren's Coop</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;44&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-111</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>We've done it. It took sweat, blood and tears, but we've done it.\n</p><p><br>\nWe know how to kill a <a href=\"/wiki/Hag\" title=\"Hag\">hag</a>.\n</p><p><br>\nMeet myself and <a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\">Adrielle</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Garlow%27s_Place\" title=\"Old Garlow's Place\">Old Garlow's</a>. This is going to change <i>everything</i>.\n</p><p><br>\nMayrina\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715022738\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27967/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6396/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936778/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.894      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.0